--------------------
- faster-whisper — MIT License. https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
- CTranslate2 (inference engine behind faster-whisper) — MIT License.
  https://github.com/OpenNMT/CTranslate2
- Whisper models (OpenAI) — MIT License. https://github.com/openai/whisper

Text-to-speech (TTS)
--------------------
- Kokoro-82M (TTS model) — Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
- kokoro-onnx (ONNX runner) — MIT License.
  https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx
